 pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.90<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 8, 2015<br/>Winter Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171106142427&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mysterious_Scroll_154031.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a mysterious scroll.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 8.50 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Strange symbols hard to decrypt. You wonder if one of the symbols looks like a foreign and mysterious creature.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This item is needed to obtain the Rift Runner mount. Only those who have finished the <a href=\"#/quest/ferumbras-ascension-quest\">Ferumbras' Ascension Quest</a> can use it. Characters who have not finished the quest will fail to use it, with the message <span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The ascension of great evil must be stopped before the secret of this scroll may be revealed.</span>\n</p><p>It has the same sprite as <a href=\"#/wiki/Note%20from%20the%20Thieves%20Guild\">Note from the Thieves Guild</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Encrypted%20Text\">Old Encrypted Text</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Piece%20of%20Paper\">Old Piece of Paper</a>, Old Pirate Poem, Parchment of Interest, Piece of Paper, <a href=\"#/wiki/Suspicious%20Documents\">Suspicious Documents</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Alchemists%27%20Formulas\">The Alchemists' Formulas</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Translation%20Scroll\">Translation Scroll</a>, and possibly other items — so beware of scams!\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>The Mysterious Scroll was only added to the <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Market%20%28Object%29\">Market</a> after July 9th, 2024.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras%20Mortal%20Shell\">Ferumbras Mortal Shell</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Bosses</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras%20Mortal%20Shell\">Ferumbras Mortal Shell</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/ferumbras-ascension-quest\">Ferumbras' Ascension Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Note%20from%20the%20Thieves%20Guild\">Note from the Thieves Guild</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Encrypted%20Text\">Old Encrypted Text</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Piece%20of%20Paper\">Old Piece of Paper</a></li><li>Old Pirate Poem</li><li>Parchment of Interest</li><li>Piece of Paper</li><li>Quests</li><li>Rift Runner</li><li>Running the Rift</li><li>Sorcerers</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Suspicious%20Documents\">Suspicious Documents</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Alchemists%27%20Formulas\">The Alchemists' Formulas</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Market%20%28Object%29\">The Market (Object)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Translation%20Scroll\">Translation Scroll</a></li><li>Valuables</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["ferumbras-ascension-quest"],"howto":{"drops":[{"creature":"Ferumbras Mortal Shell","qty":"1","hp":"300,000","exp":"2,000,000","loc":"Halls of Ascension .","places":[{"name":"Halls of Ascension","x":33304,"y":31460,"z":12,"href":"#/wiki/Halls%20of%20Ascension"}],"href":"#/wiki/Ferumbras%20Mortal%20Shell"}]}}